+#
+# THIRD UNIT: Philips 65PUS9206/12. Same board and build (ro.product.model "2021/22 Philips UHD Android TV",
+# PH1M_EA_9970A, RTT2.211108.001), so this list applies. Applied in five batches with tools/disable.sh on one
