+#   Not installed on that unit: the nettvapp* web apps, Fitness Buddy, Disney+, WhaleLive, Boosteroid,
+#   Vodafone TV, Sweet TV and Rakuten. Disabled from the factory: Netflix, Prime Video, Apple TV, YouTube
